"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1439,"Al-Hasan bin Muhammad bin Al-Sabbah told us, Ismail told us, meaning Ibn Abi Uwais, Kathir bin Abdullah told us, on the authority of his father, on the authority of his grandfather, The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to “say “Allahu Akbar” during the two Eids, seven “Allahu Akbar” in the first rak’ah, and five “Allahu Akbar” in the second rak’ah.” ""before reading"""
